3

GLM 5.2

Pydantic AI (prompt only)

39%

4

Claude Code (Opus 4.6)

Claude Code SDK

37%

5

Claude Code (Opus 4.8/4.7)

Claude Code SDK

28%

6

MiniMax M3

Pydantic AI (prompt only)

23%

7

Kimi K2.7 Code

Pydantic AI (prompt only)

22%

8

