agents, or interested in learning more about agents, join our community slack. More articles
here. Learn more about how Nori can bring your company into the glorious AI future at
norisessions.com.

1

For the folks who didn’t watch the Knicks win the playoffs, this is a very very unlikely thing
to happen

2

You would not believe how hard it was to work with some of these people. Unless you’ve ever
worked in software, in which case you probably are picturing someone in your head right now. To
be fair to them, I think their conservatism is totally warranted — the seniority often comes
from an ability to reduce complexity, and AI slop cannons are…not that.

